<Guest title="Things to Do">
  <p>Suncadia and the surrounding Cle Elum area offer year-round activities for every interest.</p>

  <h2>On the Resort</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Two championship golf courses</strong> — Prospector and Rope Rider. Locals rate from $79 (Mon–Wed after 2 PM).</li>
    <li><strong>Swim &amp; Fitness Center</strong> — indoor + outdoor pools, hot tubs, sauna. Included in the resort fee.</li>
    <li><strong>Glade Spring Spa</strong> — massage, skincare, hot springs pools.</li>
    <li><strong>Nelson Farm</strong> — axe throwing, pump track, playground, concert lawn.</li>
    <li><strong>Suncadia Adventure Park</strong> — zip line, climbing wall, ropes course.</li>
    <li><strong>Dining</strong> — Stovehouse, Swiftwater Cellars, Suncadia Lodge.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Summer Activities</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Hiking in the Cascade Mountains</li>
    <li>Mountain biking on miles of scenic trails</li>
    <li>Fishing local rivers and Lake Cle Elum</li>
    <li>Paddleboarding on Lake Cle Elum (15 min)</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Winter Activities</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Snoqualmie Pass skiing</strong> — 45 minutes; four-area pass</li>
    <li>Cross-country skiing on the resort's groomed trails</li>
    <li>Snowshoeing — guided and self-guided</li>
    <li>Sledding in designated areas</li>
    <li>Hot tub in the snow (no commute required)</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Nearby Towns</h2>

  <h3>Roslyn — 5 minutes</h3>
  <p>Historic mining town, famous as the filming location for <em>Northern Exposure</em>. Coffee, antiques, restaurants, and the Roslyn Museum.</p>

  <h3>Cle Elum — 10 minutes</h3>
  <p>Main town with shopping and dining. Safeway for groceries; gas; hardware.</p>

  <h3>Leavenworth — 1 hour</h3>
  <p>Bavarian-style village. Great day trip — restaurants, shops, river walk.</p>

